{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18dcd05cd37e649828d787033f46134f44c2681132fc4bd77f3645d89e58784d", "ja": "（初詣ライブで神様に扮したひなたが、終了後に商店街\nで買い物をしたいと言うので、待っていたんだが……）", "zh": "（日向在年初参拜演唱会上扮演神明，\n结束后她说想去商店街买东西，所以我在等她回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "48532405cdc5fab845b8b7d55b08613cea8e9ef3d65a36780416643cb84f0293", "ja": "{$P$}！　大変だよぉ。\nあたし、困っちゃったべさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}！大事不好啦～\n我遇到伤脑筋的事哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b75fa36d60434c8615ff1656d64cc9f5a1ec7a84df0599908d185dd539e4209d", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　ひなた。", "zh": "怎么了？日向？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "eb3ba0b65474085673fea56e075f3617c68f0c96f123fd86f588833ce3e30e2b", "ja": "それがね。買い物しようと思ったら、商店街の人達が、\nあたしに色々なものをくれようとしてね？", "zh": "是这样的，我去商店街买东西，\n结果那边的店家拿了很多东西要送我哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "a06da42dfb3adb1ad007371c6024a57c03df467514030877c1d0c4b58b50cb55", "ja": "魚屋さんも八百屋さんも、「かわいい神さんに」って。\nあたし、びっくりしてしまって……。", "zh": "鱼店和蔬菜店都说「要送给可爱的神明」，\n吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "96b71082e40db8ec48e2571cfb00ac7baf80b517984d9c799ec97ce3a47d93cb", "ja": "神さんに……そうか、みんなひなたのことを\n神様として接してくれてるんだな。", "zh": "送给神明……我懂了，\n大家都把日向当作神明对待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "9721e69b38a081ed5d7781001d97a858121115951baf212abd913d6a74bc0807", "ja": "でも、あたしは本当の神様じゃないっしょや……。\n{$P$}、どうしたらいいんだろか？", "zh": "不过，我又不是真的神明哪……\n{$P$}，该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1493e4b8ef1bac7ea95e998011729f009b782faedb0c15a0478b933550aacc9b", "ja": "気持ちだけでも、もらえばいいんじゃないか？\nみんなきっと、ひなたに何かしたいと思ったんだよ。", "zh": "就意思一下，收下大家的心意如何？\n大家一定是想为日向做点什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "165163a63c9b2c8641ae11b42012b9cefee39851d8998a8dd28c5e0bfdfcb42a", "ja": "申し訳ないからって全部断るより、ありがとうって\n気持ちだけでも受け取った方が喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "与其全部拒绝，不如感谢对方，收下他们的心意，\n这样大家也会开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "ddb0527d9f91aaeb76fef0a063f233ed12c360b9369fecc2176ce4f42d260f74", "ja": "みんなに、喜んでもらえる……\nそっか、そういうものなんだねぇ。", "zh": "让大家开心……\n对啊，这样才对哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "dee858766b7ccbc5d081d096c1665734cdab5784d37fbd18e927a8d262dd2c16", "ja": "ありがとねぇ、{$P$}。\nあたし、みんなにお礼を言ってくるべさ。", "zh": "谢谢你～{$P$}。\n我去跟大家道谢哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "a0c2b811a13bf4a6e065eedf95c492c8a89e1ffb01e3863da5e188aa381b8ed4", "ja": "みんなの気持ち、ちゃあんと受け取ってくるからねぇ！", "zh": "我会好好收下大家的心意～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f27196eab9e996a66e9704647c20305d6e9077a836d64e116168630a7c259fa7", "ja": "（その後、ひなたは山ほどの荷物を抱えて帰ってきた。\nたくさんの気持ちを受け取れたみたいだな）", "zh": "（后来，日向抱着一大堆礼物回来了。\n看来收到了许多人的心意呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
